cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite this software and the associated paper when using the method
  or research outputs. The paper identifier will be added when available.
type: software
title: "Neural equilibrium DF inference for dwarf spheroidal galaxies"
authors:
  - family-names: "Bibal Sobeaux"
    given-names: "Pierre-Gabriel"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Companion software for A neural equilibrium distribution-function likelihood
  for line-of-sight kinematics of dwarf spheroidal galaxies: cusp/core calibration
  and transfer. Includes the analytic projected fitter, the historical
  six-coordinate control fitter, mock generators and projected-map reanalysis.
keywords:
  - dwarf spheroidal galaxies
  - dark matter
  - distribution functions
  - stellar dynamics
